0000                          .ORG   0000h   
0000   31 00 F0               LD   SP,0xF000   
0003   CD 14 00               CALL   TEST_RLCA   
0006   CD 6B 00               CALL   TEST_RRCA   
0009   CD C2 00               CALL   TEST_RLA   
000C   CD 19 01               CALL   TEST_RRA   
