0110   C2 10 00               JP   NZ,ERROR   
0113   CB 41                  BIT   0,C   ; C flag (Bit 7 of 0xAA was 1, so Carry sets)
0115   CA 10 00               JP   Z,ERROR   
0118   C9                     RET   
